{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47513","headline":"七言 二十二 · 吕岩","name":"七言 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云鬓双明骨更轻，自言寻鹤到蓬瀛。\n日论药草皆知味，问着神仙自得名。\n簪冷夜龙穿碧洞，枕寒晨虎卧银城。\n来春又拟携筇去，爲忆轩辕海上行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}